### Soroban Smart Contract Endpoints
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contractId = CCJZ5DGASBWQXR5MPFCJXMBI333XE5U3FSJTNQU7RIKE3P5GN2K2WYD2
@apiKey = 

### Get Contract Info
GET {{baseUrl}}/soroban/contract/{{contractId}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Contract Storage
GET {{baseUrl}}/soroban/contract/{{contractId}}/storage
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Contract Functions
GET {{baseUrl}}/soroban/contract/{{contractId}}/functions
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Get Contract Expiry
GET {{baseUrl}}/soroban/contract/{{contractId}}/expiry
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Simulate Contract Invocation
POST {{baseUrl}}/soroban/simulate
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "contractId": "{{contractId}}",
  "function": "balance",
  "args": ["GAAZI4TCR3TY5OJHCTJC2A4QSY6CJWJH5IAJTGKIN2ER7LBNVKOCCWN7"]
}
